Service 3: Billing Service (Python)
This service creates and retrieves invoices — it produces the bills that the Payment Service ultimately charges.

POST /invoices/generate — Create an Invoice
Algorithm:

ini
Algorithm: GenerateInvoice(customer_id, subscription_id, period)

1. LOAD subscription details (from Subscription Service or DB)
2. GATHER line items:
   ├── base plan price
   ├── add-ons/usage charges
   └── prorated amounts (if mid-cycle changes)
3. CALCULATE taxes:
   └── rate = tax.get_tax_rate(country, region)
   └── tax  = round(subtotal × rate, 2)
4. COMPUTE totals:
   ├── subtotal  = Σ(line items)
   ├── total     = subtotal + tax
   └── store rate + tax breakdown on invoice
5. ASSIGN invoice number & UUID
6. SET status = "UNPAID"
7. PERSIST invoice to DB
8. RETURN invoice object
